<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · city</p><h1 class="enc-title">Kerman</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Kerman is a city in south-eastern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/iran">Iran</a>. In 1794 the last Zand ruler, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lotf-ali-khan">Lotf Ali Khan</a>, was captured there by Agha Muhammad Khan <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/qajar-dynasty">Qajar</a> after a prolonged siege. The city's inhabitants suffered terrible reprisals, and its fall marked the end of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/zand-dynasty">Zand Empire</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/kerman.jpg" alt="Kerman" width="320" height="240" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Foadkr · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%D9%85%D8%AC%D9%85%D9%88%D8%B9%D9%87_%DA%AF%D9%86%D8%AC%D8%B9%D9%84%DB%8C%D8%AE%D8%A7%D9%86.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
